key_patterns:
1. All shared diff/prompt logic lives in src/commit_model/diff_utils.py — every script imports from there. 2. Evaluation scripts follow the pattern: load test.jsonl -> generate predictions -> compute metrics -> print table. evaluate_ollama.py is the most complete reference. 3. Notebooks are intentionally self-contained (copy logic from diff_utils.py inline) so they run on Kaggle without the local package. 4. postprocess.py clean_message mirrors vscode-extension/src/postprocess.ts — they share test cases in vscode-extension/test/clean-cases.json and must stay identical. 5. PROMPT_TEMPLATE = 'Write a Conventional Commits message for this diff.

{diff}

Commit message:' is used everywhere and must never change. 6. SEQ_LEN=768 is the hard cap everywhere.
